# Implementation Document — AI Arena

## 1. Architecture
```text
Web Frontend
Next.js + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + Motion
        ↓
API Layer
REST/tRPC or FastAPI
        ↓
Comparison Service | Recommender Service | Analytics Service
        ↓
PostgreSQL
        ↓
Model Provider Adapters
```

## 2. Recommended Stack
Frontend: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Motion/Framer Motion, Recharts.

Backend: Next.js API/server actions or FastAPI + Python.

Database: PostgreSQL.
ORM: Prisma or SQLAlchemy.
Auth: Auth.js, Clerk, Supabase Auth, or equivalent.

